// IntroString :
"P49787852" "The Council is planning on getting a number of its men out of the country. Each one is on the most wanted list for numerous crimes, it would be a tragedy if they escaped justice. Luckily, I got a tip about where they're gathering for the voyage. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Would you be interested in rounding up these men before they can flee the country?</A> <br>I think there might be more at stake here than getting these men out of the city. I have a feeling that this could be the start of something larger."
// AcceptString :
"P1405278922" "Capture Council soldiers before they flee the country."
// SendOffString :
"P170054159" "The objective for this mission is simple. Defeat all of the Council agents at that base. Make sure none of them get away."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P227753120" "Defeat all Council on site"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2395732077" "You need to defeat those Council agents before they can escape the country."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3978642855" "This base's entrance was well hidden. If it wasn't for the tip, you'd never have found this place."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P407200127" "Initiate"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2486664634" "I cannot wait to leave this place."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2443984789" "{HeroName}! We are discovered!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2134749866" "Joining the Path will be a great honor."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1074521679" "I will not be kept from my destiny, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P267155713" "Admission to the Path will change my life."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2803234911" "I am a chosen one, {HeroName}! You won't stop me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4150396952" "You have defeated the Council fugitives. During the battle, you found a clue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P849821220" "You caught them all, {HeroName}; good work. It's a little strange that they all had these books on them. It looks more like an initiation guide than a book of information for fugitives. I'm going to look into this. Talk to me soon, I may have some more information on this 'Path of the Dark.'"
// RandomFameString :
"P2157151384" "I hear that {HeroName} is onto something big against the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3777899242" "I did a bit or research on this 'Path of the Dark' mentioned in the books you found on those fleeing Council soldiers. One of my contacts mentioned that he'd heard the name before, when he was doing some research for the Midnight Squad. Unfortunately, most of those documents were lost when the Circle of Thorns raided occult libraries in the wake of the Rikti War. He did have a rough idea where the Circle might have kept their stolen tomes. I think that learning about this 'Path of the Dark' could be very important in the long term. If you're up to it, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>getting those stolen documents back could be the first step in finding out about the Path of the Dark.</A> <br><br>The Circle won't be happy with your intrusion, so you might want to take an ally along."
// AcceptString :
"P3599602076" "Raid Oranbega for information on the Path of the Dark"
// SendOffString :
"P3077813923" "All you're looking for in there is a book that mentions the Path of the Dark. The Circle will try to stop you, but fighting them isn't your main priority. Once you have the book, you're done."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1157107235" "Get book from Circle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1698081726" "The dark halls of Oranbega press in as you begin your search for the knowledge stolen by the Circle of Thorns."
