"P1649314864" "You will go no further!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P195223264" "Trespasser!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1951068617" "Librarian Mnemcanthraxus"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P560042011" "Is there an intruder in the Library?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3482367449" "I do not tolerate those who take from us."

