// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Books2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2636021032" "None of the arcane tomes here mention The Path of The Dark."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1557811158" "You have recovered a book with a reference to The Path of The Dark."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P286062367" "This is strange, {HeroName}. This account you found makes it seem like the Path of the Dark is an ancient order dating back to Rome. Why would they be hooked up with the Council? This can't be good. I'm going to keep looking into it. I'll let you know as soon as I have something."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P700116272" "I've been researching this 'Path of the Dark' for you, and I think I may have a breakthrough. I was contacted by a man called Bentley Berkeley, who claims to have fought the Path before, back in the 1920's and 30's. Mr. Berkeley claims to be immortal, too, so I didn't really know what to make of him. But it's just possible that he may have some good leads. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Would you like me to contact him and arrange the meeting?</A> <br>This is getting into some dangerous territory, though. It might be a good idea to bring some allies with you, just in case."
// AcceptString :
"P1622005848" "Meet with Bentley Berkeley"
// SendOffString :
"P3420575761" "Okay, you'll be meeting with Bentley in an old office building he owns part of. If he's tangled with The Path of The Dark in the past, he might have some information about how they're connected to the Council. <br>According to some people I talked to, Bentley's story about being immortal seems to check out. It shouldn't be too much of a surprise, I guess. Lord Recluse himself is probably nearly a hundred years old by now."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1499309701" "Find Bentley Berkeley"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2885436749" "You'll be meeting with Bentley Berkeley in an old office building he's part owner of. All you should need to do is talk to him. <br>This is getting into some dangerous territory, though. It might be a good idea to bring some allies with you."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3995548925" "You'll never find Bentley Berkeley, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3985275871" "This old building once held a prestigious banking firm, but has now been laid low by neglect."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1953107247" "Mk II Zenith Warcry"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1270604499" "Capture of Bentley Berkeley complete. Prisoner Transferred. Prepare for Clean-up Operation."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P82136650" "You will not find your informant here, hero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1609816487" "Desk"
// InteractBeginString :
"P920714616" "You spot a note on the desk."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1108075697" "You take the note from the desk."
// InteractActionString :
"P27012917" "Reading note..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2580515726" "You take the note."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1537983916" "Bentley Berkeley has been kidnapped."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P48713188" "The Council must have grabbed Berkeley to keep him from telling you what he knows about the Path of the Dark. It looks like he was anticipating that, though. I got a message while you were out: Berkeley's sent us a set of coordinates. I'll take a look at them and see what they mean."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2035273491" "I checked those coordinates we got after Bentley Berkeley was kidnapped by the Council. They may be the location of a Council base, probably the one where they're keeping Berkeley. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, are you ready to go rescue an immortal?</A> <br>This one will probably be tough. They may not be expecting you, but they'll likely have a heavy guard on him, just in case. I'd recommend that you prepare yourself and take some friends in with you."
// AcceptString :
"P3204758426" "Rescue Bentley Berkeley"
// SendOffString :
"P74472977" "There's sure to be a lot of agents in there, but your goal is to free Bentley Berkeley. I'd hate to think of what the Council could do to him if they took their time."

