"P2614549559" "You rescued Bentley Berkeley, who directed you to see Peter Stemitz."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3150173183" "Talk to Peter Stemitz"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3679598306" "From what Bentley said, Peter Stemitz could be able to direct you to that journal. It might be able to tell us more about this 'Path of the Dark.'"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1316573798" "Attack the moment {HeroName} is sighted!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P284766698" "{HeroName}, good to see you. Yeah, I got word to expect you from good old Bentley. Man, Bentley and I used to hang out way, way back. We took on the Path, Baron Zoria and his Circle of Thorns, all kinds of weird stuff. Yeah, I was a different person then - literally. I remember more past lives than I can shake a stick at. <br>Yeah, it's weird. I just deal with it. <br>Anyway, I know where Bassie's grandson is. I already told him to expect you, so he should have his grandmother's journal for you. Let me warn you, though, that this road you're on is a dangerous one. The masters of the Path of the Dark are already aware of your interference, and are planning against you at every turn. You're on the verge of some big-time secrets, but the answers ain't gonna give you much comfort. This is so gonna get worse before it gets better, dude."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3726068028" "Find Sam Bassie, get journal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2308315319" "The Council has tried to stay a step ahead of you throughout this, {HeroName}, and I don't think they're going to stop now. Be ready."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P829011982" "You found Sam Bassie's office in the building's index easily enough. You also found Council troops waiting for you."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P346981442" "Capture of Sam Bassie is imminent."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3308810789" "Engage hostile forces!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1037984240" "Archon Royt"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1948227289" "Do our men have the book yet?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3478023414" "Ah, {HeroName}. It will be a pleasure to kill you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1507086509" "Sam Bassie"
// Description :
"P1038482478" "Find Sam Bassie"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P932530172" "I hid two other parts of my grandmother's journal when the Council showed up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3483206710" "Journals to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P2737765697" "Find last journal piece"
// InteractBeginString :
"P174021746" "You begin searching the desk."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P554170719" "You finish searching the desk."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1093855343" "You found a piece of Jennie Bassie's old journal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3714905364" "You rescued Sam Bassie from the Council and retrieved his grandmother's journal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1090359214" "The information in this journal is a lot to absorb. If Jennie Bassie was right, and Requiem was an Italian functionary from the 20's named Ridolfo Uzzano, then it could be that he got his powers from this 'Path of the Dark.' I know the Council villain Arakhn claims to be fused with a Nictus, like those Warshades you've seen running around. I've always assumed Requiem had the same story, but maybe there's something more mystical in his background. After all, he's been in operation a lot longer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2897818785" "I did a bit of digging, and I found that all of those Council agents who were being sent overseas to join the Path of the Dark. They all booked their flights through the same agency. From the low numbers of bookings and the way that they're clustered, I think that this agency might be a front for the Council. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could investigate the place and locate their records,</A> it could give us a clue to how they were channeling those men out of the country, and maybe even why they'd send them to the Path of the Dark."
// AcceptString :
"P71724910" "Investigate Council's travel agent front company"
// SendOffString :
"P3484304832" "Look for any records of where those men were going to or coming from. That could tell us a lot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1392167103" "Find travel data"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3982397340" "This place is remarkably devoid of workers for a firm of any kind. You keep on alert; the Council may be nearby."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P904218591" "Honestly, Freddie, patrol duty is the worst."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2967002898" "I know. Nothing ever happens around here anyway."

