"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3866011428" "You found some travel reports that gave you a lead. You'll need to have them decrypted, though. You instantly thought of Marisel Valenzuela, the freelance investigator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1316654218" "Get files to Marisel Valenzuela"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3824191203" "Marisel Valenzuela is probably your best  bet to get those files decrypted. She can be found in Brickstown."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1745788825" "Stop that hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2487646316" "This will be easy, {HeroName}, I will be pleased to decrypt this file for you. Any blow struck against the Council is good. I'll mark the location of the base for you. If you can find out what became of these men, it could be very important. <br><br>Be careful, however, they may have strong defenses ready for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Compound5_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1165595691" "Search base for clues"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3601631329" "Marisel's decryption was right on. That base might have a number of clues that could explain what's going on between the Path of the Dark and the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3370265193" "Beneath the warehouse you find a hidden Council complex."
