// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1230435173" "Shipping Computer"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3528387643" "You access the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P977785347" "You finish accessing the computer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2705935931" "You found a clue on the computer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2920782520" "You have found some important information about the Council and the Path of the Dark."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2250116253" "So, the initiates into the Path of the Dark return as War Wolves. That explains where the Council has been getting those creatures from. The Council former leadership didn't have them back in the 40's, so maybe this is a new development in the relationship between the Path of the Dark and the Council. If they can bring that 'Shadow Seed' to the city, they'll be able to send out hordes of War Wolves into the city. I'll start looking for more information on the seed. I'll have a new mission for you soon. There may still be time to stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3562932572" "There may still be a chance to stop the Council from smuggling a Shadow Seed into the city to start a new branch of the Path of the Dark and flood the city with their War Wolves. This is going to be a very tough battle, but if you're ready, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I know where the Seed is right now.</A> <br>This will be extremely difficult, {HeroName}. <color orange>I'd really recommend gathering as many allies as you can before you enter this one</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P84985186" "Take the Shadow Seed from the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P1749487164" "Your goal is to find the Shadow Seed. I don't know what it is or what it will look like, but if the Council can use it we may find the city overrun with their strongest monsters. It may still be in a crate, or the leader of the operation might have it. He should be a Vampyr named 'Racco.'"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2335930762" "Defeat Racco & recover Seed"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2201869204" "Your goal is to find the Shadow Seed. I don't know what it is or what it will look like, but if the Council can use it we may find the city over-run with their strongest monsters. <br>I'd also recommend defeating the leader of this operation, he should be a Vampyr named 'Racco'. He might have more information."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1307337457" "You'll never defeat the Council, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3551372026" "The darker corners of this old warehouse seem stronger somehow, and the edges of the shadows writhe at the corner of your vision. The Shadow Seed must be close."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1127742058" "Locate and neutralize the intruder."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P476375325" "Intruder located, targeting weapons."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1724387123" "Archon Racco"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3086829411" "So, {HeroName} has finally arrived."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2989464" "You've failed this time, {HeroName}! Now face the power of the Path of the Dark!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2185545326" "You begin opening the crate."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1981819548" "You have opened the crate."
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2724222072" "This crate is empty."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crate1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4174714447" "Find Shadow Seed"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1257149305" "You begin opening the crate"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4206309487" "You have opened the crate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1069554966" "This crate is now empty, but the seed was here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2802286908" "It looks like the Council was one step ahead of you. The Shadow Seed is gone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1999508904" "We missed it? How could that be? If they can plant that thing, then there could be no stopping the Council and the Path of the Dark. It's not over yet, {HeroName}. I don't know how, but I'll find some way to locate the Shadow Seed before the Path of the Dark can take root under Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl7_5thColumn1_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P865073130" "You aren't going to believe this, but I know where we can find the Shadow Seed and stop the Council's plan to plant it beneath the city! Do you remember Bentley Berkeley? The immortal guy who fought the Path of the Dark back in the 20's? Well, after you rescued him he kept following the case. He's there, now, deep underground where the Council has the Seed. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I can give you his last location the moment you're ready.</A> <br>The Council will likely throw everything they can against you to protect that thing. <color orange>You'll need all the allies, supplies, and luck you can get</color>."
// SendOffString :
"P1307600649" "The Shadow Seed is your top priority, but in order to get it away safely you'll also need to defeat the leader of the force down there, a vampyr archon called 'Ulyr.' To top it off, I think that Bentley Berkeley might be in trouble. He's done too much for the city to just leave him there to the Council's mercies. If this all works out, it could be one of the biggest defeats the Council has suffered in years."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P411361760" "Defeat Ulyr & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1128390230" "The Shadow Seed is your top priority, but in order to get it away safely you'll also need to defeat the leader of the force down there, a vampyr archon called 'Ulyr.' To top it off, I think that Bentley Berkeley might be in trouble. He's done too much for the city to just leave him there to the Council's mercies."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4168126634" "The Council shall prevail, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1527154466" "The power of the darkness down here is almost overwhelming."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1927082521" "Archon Lyvan"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4090500798" "We must succeed at this mission."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4290185909" "Your life is at an end, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P232985490" "Dark Equinox Archon"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P335576836" "We will carve a city of darkness down here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3162531833" "You will fail here, and perish!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3406935432" "Archon Ulyr"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1448512692" "In the end, the Darkness shall rule."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P99504381" "The Dark shall triumph, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Ulyr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3126426482" "Steamer trunk"
// Script Variable ACTOR_GUARDING_DIALOG :
"P643019249" "The city will be ours eternally!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_GUARDING_DIALOG :
"P1404604357" "They won't know what hit them!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3580110701" "Protect the Shadow Seed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Chest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2190937694" "Though you have destroyed the chest, the Shadow Seed is unharmed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P190978171" "Thanks for the rescue, {Rescuer}! It's getting pretty crazy down here, but I think I can find my own way out. Have ya found the Seed yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4258728059" "With the Seed in hand, Bentley Berkeley freed, and Ulyr defeated, you return to the surface."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3907370631" "The Council has suffered a major defeat, {HeroName}, and it was all thanks to you. I'll make sure the Shadow Seed gets to the DATA vaults. <br><br>It's really amazing to think about all that we've learned so far. About Requiem's origins as Ridolfo Uzzano, about the Path of the Dark. There are still so many questions, too. Is this Path of the Dark somehow related to the Nictus? I'm sure you've noted the similarities between Requiem and Arakahn's powers. If I've learned one thing in this business, it's not to trust coincidences. <br><br> But I guess that's another worry for another day. Right now, the entire city owes you a debt of thanks it may never be able to repay. You are truly {HeroAdjective}, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P3053918514" "{HeroName} rocked the Council and stopped some major plan of theirs!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P645933758" "{HeroName} saved the city from a some secret society within the Council!"
